// The node view (`cadrs_app::node_view`): the feature list as a node graph, with a
// configuration. `blocks 2`: two blocks, each a sketch and a New extrude.
// 01 The node view: a panel under the 3D view (the feature list staying on the left), a canvas
//    with the schematic's grid; each feature a node (an extrude's node its dialog), geometry traces from sketches into
//    extrudes, each node's output row, and the Parts node on the right.
// 02 + Value: the Configuration node's input `input1` (a length, 10 mm).
// 03 The input's socket dragged onto Extrude 1's Depth: Depth reads #input1, a trace from the
//    input to the field.
// 04 The wire dragged off Extrude 1's Depth onto Extrude 2's: Extrude 2 reads #input1, Extrude
//    1 its value again (one undo step).
// 05 A click on Extrude 2's body: its live dialog in its node (✓ and ✕ in the node's header).
// 06 + List, then its +: a List `Configuration` (Default, Configuration 2) in the node, the
//    configuration shown in the features header.
// 07 Configuration table…: the Configuration panel on the right, full height (beside the 3D
//    view and the node panel), the tables of the inputs.
// 07b Its left edge dragged 200 px left: the panel wider, the 3D view and node panel narrower.
// 08 Auto arrange: laid out again and framed.
// 09 The node view closed: the 3D view full height again, the List's dropdown in the list.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("blocks 2"),
        Click(ui("feature-node-view")),
        WaitFor("node-canvas"),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("01-node-view"),
        Click(ui("node-input-add")),
        WaitFor("node-input-input1-out"),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("02-input"),
        Drag(ui("node-input-input1-out"), ui("node-extrude-1-depth")),
        ExpectText("node-extrude-1", "#input1"),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("03-wired"),
        Drag(ui("node-extrude-1-depth"), ui("node-extrude-2-depth")),
        ExpectText("node-extrude-2", "#input1"),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("04-rewired"),
        Click(ui("node-extrude-2-body")),
        Wait(30),
        Screenshot("05-live"),
        Key("Escape"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(ui("node-list-add")),
        WaitFor("node-list-Configuration"),
        Click(ui("node-list-Configuration-add-row")),
        Wait(10),
        ExpectText("feature-preset", "Default"),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("06-list"),
        Click(ui("node-config-table")),
        WaitFor("configuration-panel"),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("07-table"),
        Drag(ui_at("configuration-panel-edge", 0.5, 0.5), at(1110, 500)),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("07b-wider"),
        Click(ui("node-canvas-arrange")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("08-arranged"),
        Click(ui("feature-node-view")),
        Wait(20),
        ExpectText("feature-preset", "Default"),
        Screenshot("09-list"),
    ],
)
